{"id":"514101784b6fa26f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-tm.md","title":"Turing 机","display":"df-tm — Turing 机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-tm","aliases":["20-df-tm"],"display":"df-tm — Turing 机","chapter":"1","section":"1.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.4.1","source_pdf_pages":[43],"source_printed_pages":[7],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm — Turing 机"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.4.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>7</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\\in Q\">\\(0,1\\in Q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{\\sqcup,1\\}\">\\(S=\\{\\sqcup,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_h=0\">\\(q_h=0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_s=1\">\\(q_s=1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{TM}(Q,\\delta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_h\\})\\times S\\rightharpoonup Q\\times S\\times\\{-1,+1\\},\\\\\nM:=(Q,S,\\delta,q_s,q_h),\\qquad\n\\mathcal M:=\\{(Q,S,\\delta,1,0):Q\\subseteq\\omega\\land |Q|&lt;\\omega\\land0,1\\in Q\\land\\operatorname{TM}(Q,\\delta)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{TM}(Q,\\delta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_h\\})\\times S\\rightharpoonup Q\\times S\\times\\{-1,+1\\},\\\\\nM:=(Q,S,\\delta,q_s,q_h),\\qquad\n\\mathcal M:=\\{(Q,S,\\delta,1,0):Q\\subseteq\\omega\\land |Q|&lt;\\omega\\land0,1\\in Q\\land\\operatorname{TM}(Q,\\delta)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用本书的两向无限磁带、单一停止状态与部分转移表。自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+1\">\\(x+1\\)</span> 个连续的 1；头从最左边的 1 开始。转移表是有限五元组集合且具有确定性。未定义转移可统一译成非停止循环；它不产生函数值。原接受/拒绝机公式缺括号，且与本书的数值输出模型不一致，已按原书重建。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.4.1；印刷页 7；PDF 第 43 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0,1\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{\\sqcup,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q_h=0","display":false},{"tex":"q_s=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{TM}(Q,\\delta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_h\\})\\times S\\rightharpoonup Q\\times S\\times\\{-1,+1\\},\\\\\nM:=(Q,S,\\delta,q_s,q_h),\\qquad\n\\mathcal M:=\\{(Q,S,\\delta,1,0):Q\\subseteq\\omega\\land |Q|<\\omega\\land0,1\\in Q\\land\\operatorname{TM}(Q,\\delta)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x+1","display":false}],"bytes":1395,"backlinks":[{"id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tm]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-tm]] — 章 1；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-tm]]"}],"outgoing":["3f7915f8f8ad037c"]}